    "text": "Chaudhary Bhagirath Singh Choyal, or Bhagirath Chaudhary, is an Indian politician from Rajasthan. He is a member of Lok Sabha, the lower house of the parliament since 2019. He also served as member of the Rajasthan Legislative Assembly from Kishangarh Assembly constituency. He was Chairman of the Committee on Environment in 2015-16 and 2016-17. He is a Member of Bharatiya Janata Party. He is currently serving as Minister of State for Agriculture and Farmers' Welfare in Third Modi ministry.",
